{"4876810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "of MER and MAID", "steam_appid": 4876810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your only wish is to reside in this world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;of MER and MAID&quot; you play as Diedre, member of the hidden race of Deep Ones, mermaids that once hunted humans. You live in an alternative history Europe where few years ago you met Abigail, a young witch, that saved your life. As the story starts, you come across Bela, an old demon, and an ancient dryad goddess Eden. Together you try to survive and live in a dystopian world occupied by hostile humans. But living an ordinary life doesn't seem possible, as ancient gods start to awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/6eda55670e1b2ddaa3009f7c1e4d9821.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Tactical Turn Based Combat\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to missions to fight against both the supernatural and the military. In these missions it’s not just one of you. You can take the whole group with you to even the odds against your enemies. Equip yourself with powerful weapons and items. Use the environment to your advantage. Use your supernatural abilities to destroy or temporarily incapacitate your enemies. Explore all the options in highly interactable turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/fe4f7e39c55c103f348d8d41162400d3.poster.avif?t=1788353153\" aria-label=\"Diedre is frightening looking but kind hearted\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/fe4f7e39c55c103f348d8d41162400d3.webm?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/fe4f7e39c55c103f348d8d41162400d3.mp4?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/d52e043c7a8f173d60868d2ebf7202dc.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Clean Apartments And Offices\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the more peaceful life of working an ordinary human job. Vacuum clean,  water plants, mop the floor, wash the dishes, and remove all the junk. Exploring the human world and earning a living is nice, even if you are sometimes stopped on the street by cops. To them, you are a monster after all. But maybe you can persuade them not to attack you? Maybe you can give them some food or argue with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/982ed7a8f026d0735871f88c9d4878ae.poster.avif?t=1788353153\" aria-label=\"Abigail is a powerful witch capable of levitation\" width=720 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/982ed7a8f026d0735871f88c9d4878ae.webm?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/982ed7a8f026d0735871f88c9d4878ae.mp4?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/397aa7ffd8cfee032b9eae2b450cb9ba.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Uncover Mystery Of Ancient Gods\" width=780 height=53 /></span>Discover the world of ancient god and evil cultist mystique. Find out the backstory of the gods and uncover the cultist plan to take over the world. Talk to not only your own squad members about their past but to resurrected cultists as well. Find your way to the cultist leader and find out what his plan is. What ancient god is he serving? Or does he only serve himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/636cc9d87f6e0b705fe0746c0c5824c9.poster.avif?t=1788353153\" aria-label=\"Bela has been living among humans for decades using glamour\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/636cc9d87f6e0b705fe0746c0c5824c9.webm?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/636cc9d87f6e0b705fe0746c0c5824c9.mp4?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/ff19b7f3a46d42bbb9b86281c62763a5.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Four Unique Playable Characters\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Diedre, the mermaid, daughter of the Deep One. While she is most comfortable in water she can still manage herself well with both cleaning apartments and dispatching soldiers. Play as Abigail, undead half human half Spectre witch. The most powerful one with spells she can has a lot of knowledge about the cult she was herself once part of. Play as Bela, the demon, daughter of the God Of Rage And Judgement. Maybe the deadliest of the group and definitely the most frightening. Especially if she hasn’t had her cup of coffee. Play as Eden, the Dryad, ancient goddess, thou now withering. Though she is fragile she knows how to survive. It is after all what she has been doing for tens of thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/aca68e832e295e21b00c71ca07cbc0c2.poster.avif?t=1788353153\" aria-label=\"Eden can go into the ground to hide from combat\" width=720 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/aca68e832e295e21b00c71ca07cbc0c2.webm?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/aca68e832e295e21b00c71ca07cbc0c2.mp4?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/fd08b9f821f8928e1b2d8ace403594cc.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Collectible Outfits\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect outfits and blueprints. Try to find all the different outfits each with their own properties and stat bonuses. Some are required to be allowed in certain areas. Build the equipment in your cave to craft new outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1d09b8d3ca83879de2df2e3c031875a2.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Mechanics &amp;amp; Details\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>Tactical Turn Based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>More freely with keyboard/controller or point and click with mouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>Heavy focus on interactivity of the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Gain Experience Points to unlock Abilities and increase Stats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Each of the four characters has their own set of Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Find new items including rare and powerful spells</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Unlock new outfits that give stat boosts or penalties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Gain temporary boosts and avoid getting penalties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>Unlock furniture to gain XP passively for characters that stay home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Solo missions to Clean Apartments &amp; Offices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Group missions to resurrect dead cultists</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Group story missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> In a lot of cases combat can be avoided completely</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Discuss with other group members, civilians, cult members, cops &amp; soldiers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Modular levels for offices and mansion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>of MER and MAID is being developed by a single person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your only wish is to reside in this world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;of MER and MAID&quot; you play as Diedre, member of the hidden race of Deep Ones, mermaids that once hunted humans. You live in an alternative history Europe where few years ago you met Abigail, a young witch, that saved your life. As the story starts, you come across Bela, an old demon, and an ancient dryad goddess Eden. Together you try to survive and live in a dystopian world occupied by hostile humans. But living an ordinary life doesn't seem possible, as ancient gods start to awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/6eda55670e1b2ddaa3009f7c1e4d9821.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Tactical Turn Based Combat\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to missions to fight against both the supernatural and the military. In these missions it’s not just one of you. You can take the whole group with you to even the odds against your enemies. Equip yourself with powerful weapons and items. Use the environment to your advantage. Use your supernatural abilities to destroy or temporarily incapacitate your enemies. Explore all the options in highly interactable turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/fe4f7e39c55c103f348d8d41162400d3.poster.avif?t=1788353153\" aria-label=\"Diedre is frightening looking but kind hearted\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/fe4f7e39c55c103f348d8d41162400d3.webm?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/fe4f7e39c55c103f348d8d41162400d3.mp4?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/d52e043c7a8f173d60868d2ebf7202dc.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Clean Apartments And Offices\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the more peaceful life of working an ordinary human job. Vacuum clean,  water plants, mop the floor, wash the dishes, and remove all the junk. Exploring the human world and earning a living is nice, even if you are sometimes stopped on the street by cops. To them, you are a monster after all. But maybe you can persuade them not to attack you? Maybe you can give them some food or argue with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/982ed7a8f026d0735871f88c9d4878ae.poster.avif?t=1788353153\" aria-label=\"Abigail is a powerful witch capable of levitation\" width=720 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/982ed7a8f026d0735871f88c9d4878ae.webm?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/982ed7a8f026d0735871f88c9d4878ae.mp4?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/397aa7ffd8cfee032b9eae2b450cb9ba.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Uncover Mystery Of Ancient Gods\" width=780 height=53 /></span>Discover the world of ancient god and evil cultist mystique. Find out the backstory of the gods and uncover the cultist plan to take over the world. Talk to not only your own squad members about their past but to resurrected cultists as well. Find your way to the cultist leader and find out what his plan is. What ancient god is he serving? Or does he only serve himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/636cc9d87f6e0b705fe0746c0c5824c9.poster.avif?t=1788353153\" aria-label=\"Bela has been living among humans for decades using glamour\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/636cc9d87f6e0b705fe0746c0c5824c9.webm?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/636cc9d87f6e0b705fe0746c0c5824c9.mp4?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/ff19b7f3a46d42bbb9b86281c62763a5.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Four Unique Playable Characters\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Diedre, the mermaid, daughter of the Deep One. While she is most comfortable in water she can still manage herself well with both cleaning apartments and dispatching soldiers. Play as Abigail, undead half human half Spectre witch. The most powerful one with spells she can has a lot of knowledge about the cult she was herself once part of. Play as Bela, the demon, daughter of the God Of Rage And Judgement. Maybe the deadliest of the group and definitely the most frightening. Especially if she hasn’t had her cup of coffee. Play as Eden, the Dryad, ancient goddess, thou now withering. Though she is fragile she knows how to survive. It is after all what she has been doing for tens of thousands of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/aca68e832e295e21b00c71ca07cbc0c2.poster.avif?t=1788353153\" aria-label=\"Eden can go into the ground to hide from combat\" width=720 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/aca68e832e295e21b00c71ca07cbc0c2.webm?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/aca68e832e295e21b00c71ca07cbc0c2.mp4?t=1788353153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/fd08b9f821f8928e1b2d8ace403594cc.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Collectible Outfits\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect outfits and blueprints. Try to find all the different outfits each with their own properties and stat bonuses. Some are required to be allowed in certain areas. Build the equipment in your cave to craft new outfits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1d09b8d3ca83879de2df2e3c031875a2.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"Mechanics &amp;amp; Details\" width=780 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>Tactical Turn Based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>More freely with keyboard/controller or point and click with mouse</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>Heavy focus on interactivity of the world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Gain Experience Points to unlock Abilities and increase Stats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Each of the four characters has their own set of Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Find new items including rare and powerful spells</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Unlock new outfits that give stat boosts or penalties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Gain temporary boosts and avoid getting penalties</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>Unlock furniture to gain XP passively for characters that stay home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Solo missions to Clean Apartments &amp; Offices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Group missions to resurrect dead cultists</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Group story missions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> In a lot of cases combat can be avoided completely</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Discuss with other group members, civilians, cult members, cops &amp; soldiers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span><strong> Modular levels for offices and mansion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/extras/1ce0a986935065000a780b00e7557236.webp?t=1788353153\" alt=\"\"width=14 height=14 /></span> <strong>of MER and MAID is being developed by a single person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Vacuum and mop your way through a world of tyrannical oligarchs and ancient gods as either a mermaid, a demon, a ghost witch, or a dryad. But when a cabal of cultists threatens all, you will need to switch the mop for weapons and spells and embark on tactical turn-based missions to even the odds.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/b44cf60c3023158cd50b8fadfb8e67805816d887/header.jpg?t=1788353153", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/7866d49cadaee0f15b74f074050ad755373be98a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788353153", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4876810/7866d49cadaee0f15b74f074050ad755373be98a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788353153", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB availabl